WEBVTT

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:06.020
Going for a walk in the forest feels great!

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.690
Well, aren't you carefree!

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:12.490
We're here to find a clue to the princess.

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:15.590
We're here!

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.400
Indeed.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.700
This is a collection of world-famous sculptures,

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.230
the Forest Sculpture Gallery!

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:30.980
The princess loved sculptures.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:34.980
Maybe she came to see them in this world, too!

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.050
But...

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.720
whenever she looked at sculptures, {Gee, I wonder who these are sculptures of.}

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.950
her eyes seemed so sad.

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:50.830
Anyway, we're gonna search this gallery together!

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:51.830
Right!

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.270
And perhaps...

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:57.470
we might find the fourth Royal Crystal.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.540
Or so I feel.

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:01.370
Hi!

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:07.510
Regina!

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:15.190
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:17.660
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:20.530
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.560
Every day it sparkles

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:33.140
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:38.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:44.450
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:49.890
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:55.590
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:55.790 --> 00:02:04.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.140
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:08.540
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:11.380
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:14.180
What's more than just cute

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:18.050
is our promise between girls

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:24.090
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:30.000
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:42.010
Shock!

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:42.010
Shock!

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:45.080
Regina, why are you here?

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:46.850
Mana, listen!

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.210
I'll be a good girl this time!

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.750
All so we can be real friends!

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:54.330
It's fine for you to be friends,

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:57.720
but have you reflected on your actions from last time?

00:02:57.960 --> 00:02:59.260
Last time?

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:03.140
You made a Selfish and hurt us all, remember?

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:04.690
Of course I reflected!

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:05.790
Really?

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:06.720
Totally!

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:10.080
Do you understand what it means to reflect on your actions?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:10.670
Huh?

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.370
Nope!

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:19.000
Well, we can explain what that means later. {lit. "little by little," but that sounds off here.}

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:23.490
But Regina, you have to be friends with everyone, not just me.

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:25.050
Everyone?

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.580
Yeah, everyone!

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.620
I-I'll try!

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.690
<i>Huh? Is she...</i>

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:37.360
<i>A bit different from before?</i>

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:39.640
Yeah, you can do it!

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:40.350
Mana.

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:42.600
Makopi?

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:47.420
Don't tell her about our search for the princess or the Royal Crystals, okay?

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:48.830
S-Sure.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.310
So, whatcha doin' here?

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.900
Well, uh, you see, um...

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:58.070
We came to see the sculptures, of course!

00:03:58.070 --> 00:03:59.950
Right, right! Quite right indeed!

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.490
In that case,

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.100
there's a great sculpture over here!

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.510
Let's go see it!

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:14.970
W-Wait, Regina!

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:16.440
Stop!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.300
What's wrong, Mana?

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.160
When you're walking,

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.770
it's best to walk together!

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:26.750
Aw, but I want to be alone with you!

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:29.180
You want to be friends with everyone, right?

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:34.450
But that ice cream I ate with you the other day was tasty.

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:36.880
Yeah, it tastes good with two,

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:40.960
but it'd taste even better with the five of us!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.420
It'd be more fun, too!

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:43.650
I guess...

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:44.880
I know!

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:50.370
I really only want Mana, but I'll put up with them!

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:54.340
It's hard to get angry when she's that honest...

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.350
Are you all right?

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:02.010
Alice.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.650
Yes, I'm fine.

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:12.050
<i>It's calling me!</i>

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.330
Makopi?

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.230
Makoto?

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.580
Makopi, what's up?

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:28.340
This statue...

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.740
looks just like the princess!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.150
Princess?

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:37.020
Oh, pay no mind!

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.680
Yeah, it's nothing, really!

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:43.330
Ah, quite the lovely statue.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:47.840
The Solitaire owner?!

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.660
Oh, hello there.

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:52.060
Ai too?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.070
That's a funny hat!

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.090
And this lady is?

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:59.010
I'm Regina.

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:00.770
It's a lovely name.

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.710
It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:05.510
<i>Why is he here?</i>

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:08.950
<i>And right by the statue that resembles the princess, at that?</i>

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.480
What are you here for, Mister?

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:16.510
This statue is a new addition, and I fell in love at first sight.

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:22.060
Or perhaps I should say that the statue fell for me...

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:24.420
He's a laugh and a half!

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:26.400
Hey, Regina!

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:32.390
Wait, do you know the model of this statue?

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:33.250
Huh?

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.940
Oh dear, look at the time!

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.500
I have an important business meeting to attend!

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.030
Take care of Ai, if you'd please!

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:43.250
Hey, wait!

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.400
He took his leave.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:49.230
What was he gonna do about Ai if we weren't here?

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.260
Aiya, Ai!

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:02.530
Why are you crying?

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:04.190
Let me handle it!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.450
At times like this...

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.740
You need this Lovies!

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:18.090
Yo! Checka Racka!

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:42.570
She's so cute asleep!

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.040
<i>Just like Mana said.</i>

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.700
<i>Her smile was not a lie.</i>

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:51.580
Mana, what do you think of this statue?

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:54.520
Well, it's a very beautiful person.

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:56.050
Yeah, I like it too!

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:59.150
Especially that jewel in her chest!

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:03.790
Hey, could that be a Royal Crystal?

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:05.090
What's that?

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:07.150
Well, it's...

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:10.130
It's a really royal looking crystal!

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:12.480
Hey, you're lying.

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:15.160
Lying's the first step towards a life of crime.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:19.030
You seem to know that proverb well...

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:24.650
Well, Royal Crystals are very important things that we're searching for.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:28.980
Then I'll give you a present!

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:33.260
Wait...

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:49.830
Here, Mana.

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:52.880
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What do we do?!

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:01.120
Yeah, I figured.

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.420
Do you have <i>any</i> idea what you did?!

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:04.890
We're sorry!

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:06.460
We're sorry!

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:07.960
We're extremely sorry!

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.400
Geez...

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:13.510
Hey, don't get so mad.

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:14.490
Sir... {I'm aware that "Sir" isn't really a translation for sensei, but considering the business relationship between an artist and curator, I feel it fits.}{b-but you translated it as Sir in episode 1}{How about fuck you}{rude}

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:16.570
You must be...

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:21.040
He's Mr. Hitomi, the artist behind the statue you broke!

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:23.410
We're sorry!

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:24.990
Don't worry.

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:27.420
It wasn't something little girls could break. {Confirmed for not know shit about what show he's in.}

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:30.010
There must have been a crack in it somewhere.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.910
But even I think it's strange.

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:37.620
I feel like it was never my work to begin with.

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:38.920
Huh?

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:41.970
When I picked that red stone up by the river,

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.900
I was struck by sudden inspiration.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:49.860
It was like I made that statue by someone else's commands.

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:52.500
But this is just a piece of glass.

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:54.490
Regina!

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:57.990
Well, everything breaks someday.

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:02.450
That was the fate of this statue.

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:06.760
We're really very sorry!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.550
What are you doing?

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:17.840
Cleaning up.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.800
You don't have to.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.370
He forgave you.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.230
It's the thought that counts.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.660
We can't put it back together,

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:27.570
but we can at least do this.

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:30.240
But I was the one who broke it.

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:32.040
You've got nothing to do with it.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.440
What are you saying?

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.440
We're friends, remember?

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.050
Friends?

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.050
Because we're friends,

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:43.760
we want to stick together through the good times and the bad.

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:50.230
Well, when you're friends with someone who takes on other people's troubles as much as Mana,

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:51.470
expect a lot of bad.

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:54.930
Well, if you'd be so kind as to bear with me...

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:57.970
Oh well, I <i>guess</i> I'll hang in there.

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:05.910
I want it, too...

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.020
I want...

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.330
to be...

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:13.890
your friend!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.570
What are you talking about?

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.650
You're already our friend.

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:28.750
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:31.900
<i>My heart is beating out of my chest!</i>

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:45.920
A Royal Crystal!

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:56.130
Regina, you okay?

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:08.330
This is a Royal Crystal!

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:10.160
Regina?

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.820
Those Royal Crystals...

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:20.510
all belong to me now.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.380
Now hand them over.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:25.160
You can't, Regina!

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:28.310
We told you before, they're very important—

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:30.390
I'm <i>saying</i> I want them!

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:31.950
Regina?

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:34.000
Why are you acting weird?

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.040
Not gonna?

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.200
Then I'll steal them from you!

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:41.740
How's the cleanup coming?

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:48.110
That sparkle!

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:51.380
I feel some more inspiration coming on!

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:52.750
Good timing.

00:12:57.110 --> 00:13:01.430
I'll turn you into a splendid Selfish!

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.100
Selfishtatue!

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:34.130
Art is...

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:35.860
wreckage! {2deep4me}

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:38.960
Let's go, girls!

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.670
Charles!

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:45.590
Precure Love Link!

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:47.280
L-O-V-E!

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:48.000
L-O-V-E!

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:48.720
L-O-V-E!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:49.860
L-O-V-E!

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:17.770
Brimming with love,

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.850
Cure Heart!

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:24.120
The light of wisdom,

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:26.420
Cure Diamond!

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:30.690
The warmth of the sun,

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.000
Cure Rosetta!

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:35.730
The blade of courage,

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:37.990
Cure Sword!

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.760
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:45.400
Dokidoki Precure!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:49.700
Oh poor sculpture who has lost his love,

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:51.800
I, Cure Heart,

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:55.310
will make your heart race once more!

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.550
My heart doesn't need to race.

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:00.650
I'll just defeat you Precures and take the Royal Crystals myself!

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.110
Sculpture!

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.180
Regina!

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:05.150
Wreckage!

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:08.720
Wreck! Wreck, wreeeeck!

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:13.420
Wreck, wreck... wreck!

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:16.260
The sculptures!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.840
Wreckage!

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:21.120
Stop it!

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:24.340
Don't break any more of them!

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.770
Wreckage!

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.380
Love Heart Arrow!

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:37.820
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:44.450
It didn't work!

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:50.200
Heart!

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:53.510
Sword!

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:00.310
Take these!

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:05.130
Sword!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:06.780
Sword was turned into a statue?

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:08.150
How horrible!

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.710
Welcome to my collection! {No fair, I want a Sword statue. ;_;}

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.060
The birth of a masterpiece!

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:21.190
Now, who will be my next work of art?

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:22.860
I'll take care of him!

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:26.680
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.300
It worked!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.140
Art is...

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:36.670
wreckage!

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:40.010
The Diamond Shower didn't work?

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:41.150
Wreckage!

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:44.400
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:01.430
The Rosetta Reflection, too?

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:02.600
Statue!

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:12.110
Rosetta! Diamond!

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:16.650
The birth of two masterpieces!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:18.670
Girls...

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.820
That's my Selfish for you.

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:24.940
Regina, turn them all back to normal!

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.200
Sure.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:29.460
But only if you give me all the Royal Crystals.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.160
If you refuse,

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:37.740
I'll smash all of your precious friends to pieces!

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:44.340
Regina, what happened?

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:51.350
I thought you were getting along with
everyone today, not just me!

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:59.220
Back then, I was so happy that my heart skipped a beat!

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:02.270
Didn't yours?

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:10.000
What a load.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.000
Do you listen to yourself?

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:13.320
Regina!

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:17.070
Well, since it looks like you don't care about saving your friends,

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:19.760
I'm done trying to cut you some lame deal.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:20.740
Selfish!

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:23.320
Steal the Royal Crystals!

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:26.020
Wreckage!

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:33.220
Wreck, wreck, wreck!

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:37.900
Wreckage!

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.560
Precure Heart Shoot!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:59.080
What a moron.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:01.110
Shoulda just handed them over.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:05.070
Now, complete your collection of Precure statues!

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:09.460
Now, statue!

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:22.390
Mister! {OH SNAP IT'S TUXEDO MASK!}

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:26.160
Fire a Heart Shoot at your friends!

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:27.160
Huh?

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:28.410
Why?

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:31.390
You should be able to return your friends to normal!

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:32.320
Hurry!

00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:36.060
Girls...

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:38.760
I'm going to save you!

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:40.090
I won't let you!

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:40.930
Hey now!

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:44.300
I'm your opponent.

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:49.040
Precure Heart Shoot!

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:01.240
Girls!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:04.350
Selfish!

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.550
Wreckage!

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:08.700
Girls, let's go!

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:09.430
Right!

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:20.160
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:42.320
Love love loooooove!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:50.950
What was I...

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:55.600
Now, return the Royal Crystal!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:58.320
Who do you think I am?

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:01.610
I'm King Selfish's daughter, Regina!

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:12.580
Mister!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:15.050
I-I'm fine.

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:17.830
I'll go home for today.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:19.660
But remember this:

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:23.230
the Royal Crystals all belong to me!

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:24.170
See ya!

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:27.900
Regina...

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:32.070
There, there...

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:36.740
Just who are you?

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:38.380
That armor!

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:42.350
It's the mark of a Trump Kingdom warrior!

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:46.780
What were you to the princess?

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:51.290
My name is Jonathan Klondike.

00:21:52.380 --> 00:21:54.490
Princess Ann's fiancé. {I know, her full name is Ange, but he calls her アン, which I assume is a cute nickname. Using Ann sounds like he's referring to someone else, but using "An" as a name is just wrong.}

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:01.130
The princess's fiancé?

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:28.530
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:31.460
It's Appeared!

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:31.460
It's Appeared!

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:33.760
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
